      "content": "The draft is a good start, but it's a bit vague. If the union lawyers get ahold of this, they're going to demand specifics. I need you to actually include the reasoning in the memo. Specifically, explain how these tighter turnaround windows actually protect driver safety or incorporate necessary rest periods better than the old system. Give me some concrete language I can use to prove we aren't cutting corners on safety.",
